   "text": "A, B, or C?"
  },
  {
   "id": "S1_N",
   "t0": 5.284,
   "t1": 6.965,
   "text": "An old man's only horse ran away."
  },
  {
   "id": "S2_N",
   "t0": 7.115,
   "t1": 11.977,
   "text": "Neighbors said: so sad! He smiled: maybe it's luck."
  },
  {
   "id": "S3_N",
   "t0": 12.727,
   "t1": 14.629,
   "text": "Then it came back with a wild horse!"
  },
  {
   "id": "S4_N",
   "t0": 14.779,
   "t1": 16.115,
   "text": "Now he had two horses!"
  },
  {
   "id": "R_M",
   "t0": 16.965,
   "t1": 18.595,
   "text": "塞翁失马。",
